#: filterlogdialog.cpp:47
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Share…"
msgstr "Comparti…"

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:49
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Filter Log Viewer"
msgstr "Visor de registro de Filtro"

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:71
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "&Log filter activities"
msgstr "&Registra activitates de filtro"

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:76
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You can turn logging of filter activities on and off here. Of course, log "
"data is collected and shown only when logging is turned on. "
msgstr ""
"Ci tu pote activar/de-activar registration de activitate de filtro. "
"Naturalmente, data registrate es colligite e monstrate solo quando le "
"registration es activate."

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:97
#, kde-format
msgid "Logging Details"
msgstr "Detalios de registro"

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:104
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Log pattern description"
msgstr "Description de modello de registro"

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:109
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Log filter &rule evaluation"
msgstr "Valutation de &regula de filtro de registro"

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:114
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You can control the feedback in the log concerning the evaluation of the "
"filter rules of applied filters: having this option checked will give "
"detailed feedback for each single filter rule; alternatively, only feedback "
"about the result of the evaluation of all rules of a single filter will be "
"given."
msgstr ""
"Tu pote controlar le retorno in le registro reguardante le valutation del "
"regulas de filtro de filtros applicate: si on ha iste option marcate, on "
"habera un detaliate retorno pro cata singule regula de filtro; in altere "
"modo solmente essera date le  retorno a proposito del resultato de  "
"valutation de omne regulas de un singule filtro."

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:121
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Log filter pattern evaluation"
msgstr "Valutation de modello de filtro de registro"

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:126
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Log filter actions"
msgstr "Actiones de filtro de registro"

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:136
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Log size limit:"
msgstr "Limite de dimension de registro:"

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:144
#, kde-format
msgid " KB"
msgstr " KB"

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:145
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox Set the size of the logfile to unlimited."
msgid "unlimited"
msgstr "sin limite"

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:148
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Collecting log data uses memory to temporarily store the log data; here you "
"can limit the maximum amount of memory to be used: if the size of the "
"collected log data exceeds this limit then the oldest data will be discarded "
"until the limit is no longer exceeded. "
msgstr ""
"Colliger datos de registro usa memoria pro immagazinar temporaneemente datos "
"de registro; hic tu pote liminar le quantitate maxime de memoria que on debe "
"usar: si le dimension de datos colligite excede iste limite alora le data "
"plus vetere essera abandonate usque le limite non es ancora excedite."

#: filterlogdialog.cpp:326
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Could not write the file %1:\n"
"\"%2\" is the detailed error description."
msgstr ""
"Il non pote scriber le file %1:\n"
"\"%2\" es le detaliate description de error."

